---
name: checking-project-decisions
description: Use when about to edit UI, styles, tokens, fonts, colors, motion, animations, copy or tests in any of Nico's projects (Whopper King, CotizaIA, CanTrack, Interfaces/Retoma/Hand Hygiene, the fe factory) or any repo with DESIGN.md, STACK.md, CASE.md, FINDINGS.md, DESIGN-PASS.md or a tokens file; also when delegated a frontend brief, a design pass, a polish or "make it premium" task
